What’s New
New Feature: Local Events
A dedicated section has been added under Functionality and Adventure and Exploration to offer hyper-local event recommendations tailored to the user's location and interests. This change empowers older users to discover neighborhood events such as community fairs, workshops, meetups, and local wellness programs—promoting community involvement and social wellness.
Highlights:
•	Integration with local event feeds and calendars
•	Filters by interest (e.g., fitness, culture, hobbies)
•	Real-time updates and event notifications
New Feature: Emergency Contacts
In response to feedback prioritizing safety and wellness, a new Emergency Contacts component has been integrated across the Health and Wellness and Accessibility sections. This ensures rapid access to important contacts in emergencies and supports peace of mind for both users and their families.
Highlights:
•	One-touch call feature to preset emergency contacts
•	Customizable ICE (In Case of Emergency) profile
•	Optional integration with health monitoring alerts
